### PolicyFlow REST API Examples & Manual Test Harness

### 1. Intake - Create New Policy Request (HTTP 201 Expected)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-0001",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Sample Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-14",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### 2. Intake - Repeated Submission (Idempotent Duplicate Intake - HTTP 200 Expected)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-0001",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Sample Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-14",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### 3. Intake - Validation Failure (Inverted dates - HTTP 422 Expected)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-INVALID",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Invalid Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-20",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-10",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### 4. List All Policy Requests (Paginated)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests
Accept: application/json

### 5. Fetch Policy Details & Audit Trail by UUID
# Replace with actual UUID from step 1
GET http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests/YOUR_POLICY_UUID_HERE
Accept: application/json

### 6. Submit Issuance - SUCCESS scenario
POST http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests/YOUR_POLICY_UUID_HERE/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "scenario": "SUCCESS"
}

### 7. Submit Issuance - TIMEOUT_AFTER_ISSUE scenario (Simulate HTTP 504 / NEEDS_RECONCILIATION)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests/YOUR_POLICY_UUID_HERE/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "scenario": "TIMEOUT_AFTER_ISSUE"
}

### 8. Reconcile Policy against Provider
POST http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests/YOUR_POLICY_UUID_HERE/reconcile
Accept: application/json

### 9. Mock Insurer Webhook Callback (Dispatches confirmation event)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/mock-insurer/callback
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "event_id": "EVT-MANUAL-001",
  "provider_reference": "PRV-XXXXXX",
  "event_type": "POLICY_ISSUED",
  "policy_number": "POL-2026-123456"
}
